{"schema":"SDW_SCRIPTURE_CHAPTER_V1","revision":"52add6f41edc5dd9c21f65f02f933fbd1cec266285bee8bce249607475050398","canonicalSourceHash":"f9dfbce6dd2edfe4bb3b4690acd6622f392035be2b0349df98f3607f0a05f6c2","bookId":"engwebu:psa","chapter":33,"verses":[{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":33,"verse_ordinal":428,"verse_start":1,"verse_end":1,"verse_label":"1","text":"Rejoice in the LORD, you righteous! Praise is fitting for the upright.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":1505},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":33,"verse_ordinal":429,"verse_start":2,"verse_end":2,"verse_label":"2","text":"Give thanks to the LORD with the lyre. Sing praises to him with the harp of ten strings.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":1508},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":33,"verse_ordinal":430,"verse_start":3,"verse_end":3,"verse_label":"3","text":"Sing to him a new song. Play skillfully with a shout of joy!","is_omitted":0,"source_line":1511},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":33,"verse_ordinal":431,"verse_start":4,"verse_end":4,"verse_label":"4","text":"For the LORD’s word is right. All his work is done in faithfulness.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":1514},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":33,"verse_ordinal":432,"verse_start":5,"verse_end":5,"verse_label":"5","text":"He loves righteousness and justice. The earth is full of the loving kindness of the LORD.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":1517},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":33,"verse_ordinal":433,"verse_start":6,"verse_end":6,"verse_label":"6","text":"By the LORD’s word, the heavens were made: all their army by the breath of his mouth.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":1520},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":33,"verse_ordinal":434,"verse_start":7,"verse_end":7,"verse_label":"7","text":"He gathers the waters of the sea together as a heap. He lays up the deeps in storehouses.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":1523},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":33,"verse_ordinal":435,"verse_start":8,"verse_end":8,"verse_label":"8","text":"Let all the earth fear the LORD. Let all the inhabitants of the world stand in awe of him.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":1526},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":33,"verse_ordinal":436,"verse_start":9,"verse_end":9,"verse_label":"9","text":"For he spoke, and it was done. He commanded, and it stood firm.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":1529},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":33,"verse_ordinal":437,"verse_start":10,"verse_end":10,"verse_label":"10","text":"The LORD brings the counsel of the nations to nothing. He makes the thoughts of the peoples to be of no effect.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":1532},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":33,"verse_ordinal":438,"verse_start":11,"verse_end":11,"verse_label":"11","text":"The counsel of the LORD stands fast forever, the thoughts of his heart to all generations.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":1535},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":33,"verse_ordinal":439,"verse_start":12,"verse_end":12,"verse_label":"12","text":"Blessed is the nation whose God is the LORD, the people whom he has chosen for his own inheritance.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":1538},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":33,"verse_ordinal":440,"verse_start":13,"verse_end":13,"verse_label":"13","text":"The LORD looks from heaven. He sees all the sons of men.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":1541},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":33,"verse_ordinal":441,"verse_start":14,"verse_end":14,"verse_label":"14","text":"From the place of his habitation he looks out on all the inhabitants of the earth,","is_omitted":0,"source_line":1544},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":33,"verse_ordinal":442,"verse_start":15,"verse_end":15,"verse_label":"15","text":"he who fashions all of their hearts; and he considers all of their works.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":1546},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":33,"verse_ordinal":443,"verse_start":16,"verse_end":16,"verse_label":"16","text":"There is no king saved by the multitude of an army. A mighty man is not delivered by great strength.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":1549},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":33,"verse_ordinal":444,"verse_start":17,"verse_end":17,"verse_label":"17","text":"A horse is a vain thing for safety, neither does he deliver any by his great power.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":1552},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":33,"verse_ordinal":445,"verse_start":18,"verse_end":18,"verse_label":"18","text":"Behold, the LORD’s eye is on those who fear him, on those who hope in his loving kindness,","is_omitted":0,"source_line":1555},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":33,"verse_ordinal":446,"verse_start":19,"verse_end":19,"verse_label":"19","text":"to deliver their soul from death, to keep them alive in famine.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":1558},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":33,"verse_ordinal":447,"verse_start":20,"verse_end":20,"verse_label":"20","text":"Our soul has waited for the LORD. He is our help and our shield.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":1561},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":33,"verse_ordinal":448,"verse_start":21,"verse_end":21,"verse_label":"21","text":"For our heart rejoices in him, because we have trusted in his holy name.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":1564},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":33,"verse_ordinal":449,"verse_start":22,"verse_end":22,"verse_label":"22","text":"Let your loving kindness be on us, LORD, since we have hoped in you.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":1567}]}